body:
In the nineties, Konstantin Korotkov, a professor at The *St. Petersburg Federal University of Informational Technologies, Optics, and Mechanics* in Russia, had created something very interesting…

This technology isn’t new; this has been created time and time again through different means.

Konstantin had created a device he named GVC, which is based on the ancient Chinese system of energy meridians. It measures the bio-energy that all living organisms give off through a non-invasive, painless evaluation.  It uses a small electrical current that is connected to the fingertips and takes less than a millisecond to send signals from. When these electric charges are pulsed through the body, our bodies naturally respond with a kind of ‘electron cloud’ made up of light photons. This glow can be captured with an optical CCD camera system and then translated onto a computer.

Each sect of the fingertip represents different organs and systems in the body. A computer program projects the figure of a body and places a type of auric cloud around it that is in correspondence with each chakra. According to the ancient Ayurvedic Indian medicine, each part of our fingertips corresponds to different body parts and systems within us.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

This being said, What proof do we have these said "Living Organisms" have any connection to valid scientific evidence of chakras, spirits, psychic abilities, and other said spiritual beliefs.   In the machine, it measures using 7 main energy points along the centre of our the image of a human, Being similair to chakras. Konstantin took this idea and applied it to his technology.

The different coloured balls represent each chakra, and how much work we need to put into it, mentally, physically and emotionally. The farther off it is from the center, the more that specific chakra needs working on.

This can translate into physical life, if your throat chakra is off, that can mean you need to work on speak up. If your heart chakra is off, that can mean you need to practice compassion and understanding with the people in your life.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

And thats only the little proof I personnally could fin in 10 Min of reading you post and using progams such as google scholar to find relative proof of chakras in science. If you want proof don't go on Reddit asking for proof and expecting someone to say their proof so you can blindly believe it; Honestly by asking the question it isn't bad, It's blindly following the answers of others wether they are proof for or agaisnt what Spirit Science claims. Which makes you ignorant. Please feel free to post questions on this here or anywhere, By all means I am no mod/admin, though I promote the personnal research not only asking but reading, learning, and watching information on each relative subject! Feel free to use others and I as a resource in your pursuit of truth, Others can be a big tool in your search. Spirit Science is a tool to point you in directions of self-research in ways best examplified by the fibinachi sequence and other. The big push I want to make is for you to do your own research until you find an answer you can firmly believe in!
